[IMPORTANT NOTICE]
This project (the "Hunyuan AI Studio OpenAI-Compatible Proxy", including all source
code, scripts, documents, protocol profiles and test data, hereinafter the "Software")
is a personal study / technical-research project. It is NOT an official product of
Tencent or its affiliates, and has NOT been authorized, endorsed, or approved by
Tencent.

The Software wraps the chat capability that you can already use with YOUR OWN account
on the Tencent Hunyuan (AI Studio) web front-end into a local OpenAI-compatible API,
by reusing your own browser session. By using the Software you confirm that you have
read, understood and agreed to all terms below; otherwise, stop using it and delete
all copies immediately.

