     to third parties; bundling into products; use in internal production/business
     systems; customer acquisition, advertising or traffic monetization; reselling
     the Software as SaaS/API; charging others in any form (including charging for
     deployment or maintenance).
 1.3 "Upstream Service" means the Tencent Hunyuan (AI Studio) web front-end and the
     interfaces, models and account system behind it.

